 "notes": "Prices are KDV dahil (20% VAT) taken from each product page's 'product-price' element; the site's category listings, homepage and JSON-LD show the KDV-haric figure (e.g. P2S 28,664.21 ex-VAT = 34,397.05 inc-VAT). Catalogue built from the product sitemap (1,564 URLs; 718 relevant pages scraped). Nearly all items are marked 'Tukendi' (out of stock) — included regardless. Excluded: Bambu H2D/H2S/H2C laser-only variants are folded into notes, spare parts, 3D pens, scanners, MMU3 (29,867.33, listed as multiColorSystem option), Prusa upgrade kits (MK3S->MK4 46,927.58 ex-VAT etc.), Raise3D RMF500/MetalFuse (0.00 quote-only), IEMAI YM-NT-750/1000/1200 large-format industrial (no price), Flsun category (empty). Bambu combos: combo price = printer + AMS/AMS lite/AMS 2 Pro. Specs not on retailer pages were filled from Bambu Lab spec sheets/wiki (P2S, X2D, A2L, H2C power tables), Prusa and manufacturer data; ratedPowerW = manufacturer max power, avgPrintPowerW = typical PLA steady-state where published, otherwise estimate. Elegoo resin bottles without stated weight assumed 1 kg. Bambu filament: refillPriceTRY = refill (no spool) price; median across colours used. Prusament PLA/PETG special colours 970 g. Some Bambu listings had anomalous prices (PLA Basic single colour at 4,587.73; PLA Dynamic 0.00) — excluded from medians."
